"entity": {
"name": "Mota-Engil SGPS SA",
"description": "Mota-Engil SGPS SA engages in the provision of construction, engineering, environmental services, transport concessions, energy, and mining. It operates through the following business segments: Africa Engineering and Construction, Environment, Latin America \u2013 E&C, Europe \u2013 E&C, Capital and Mext. The Africa - E&C segment includes engineering and construction activities. The Environment segment deals with treatment, recovery and collection of urban & international waste. The Latin America - E&C segment focuses on energy generation and sales business in Mexico, concession management and operation business in Mexico and Colombia. The Europe - E&C segment offers activities carried out by the group in Portugal. The Capital segment encompasses with Services, Concessions, Tourism & Mobility in Portugal & Poland. The Mext segment comprises with Innovation and development, real estate, Agroforestry & Mining. The company was founded by Manuel Ant\u00f3nio da Mota on June 29, 1946 and is headquartered in Porto, Portugal.",
"rbics_econ": "Industrials",
"rbics_sector": "Industrial Services",
"rbics_subsector": "Facilities and Construction Services",
"rbics_indgrp": "Infrastructure Construction/Contracting Services",
